---
description: Prepare one freezeAssembly evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: DocumentaryClearance[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Produce a versioned edit decision list, script, asset manifest, and unresolved-work register. Verify exact timecodes and duration, bind approvals to the assembly, and invalidate affected checks when a source clip or sequence changes. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
